  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Toast the double rise bread until crispy.",
    "Marinate the vegan beef strips in garlic and spices for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat the hot beef stock in a saucepan until simmering.",
    "Add the marinated vegan beef strips to the beef stock and cook until heated through.",
    "Prepare the lotus leaf wraps by rinsing them in cold water and patting them dry.",
    "Assemble the wraps by placing a slice of toasted bread, some shredded lettuce, diced tomato, thinly sliced red onion, and a few strips of the cooked vegan beef on each lotus leaf.",
    "Season with smoked paprika, salt, and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional garlic and spices if desired."
  ],
